an.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/auto-techsupport/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/auto-techsupport/", "title": "AUTO_TECHSUPPORT \u30c6\u30fc\u30d6\u30eb", "content_html": "AUTO_TECHSUPPORT \u30c6\u30fc\u30d6\u30eb \u2014 \u30a4\u30d9\u30f3\u30c8\u99c6\u52d5 (core dump \u751f\u6210) \u3067 show techsupport \u3092\u81ea\u52d5\u5b9f\u884c\u30fb\u53e4\u3044\u30c0\u30f3\u30d7\u3092\u6383\u9664\u3059\u308b\u6a5f\u80fd\u306e\u8a2d\u5b9a\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/auto-techsupport.png", "date_modified": "2026-05-28T00:37:19+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-09T19:46:50+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/state-bgp/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/state-bgp/", "title": "STATE_DB BGP \u95a2\u9023\u30c6\u30fc\u30d6\u30eb", "content_html": "STATE_DB / BMP_STATE_DB \u306e BGP \u95a2\u9023\u30c6\u30fc\u30d6\u30eb\uff08BGP_STATE_TABLE\u30fbBGP_PEER_CONFIGURED_TABLE\u30fbBGP_NEIGHBOR_TABLE\u30fbBGP_RIB_IN_TABLE\u30fbBGP_RIB_OUT_TABLE\uff09\u306e\u30b9\u30ad\u30fc\u30de\u30fb\u30d5\u30a3\u30fc\u30eb\u30c9\u30c7\u30d5\u30a9\u30eb\u30c8\u30fb\u66f8\u304d\u8fbc\u307f\u30bf\u30a4\u30df\u30f3\u30b0\u3092\u89e3\u8aac\u3059\u308b\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/state-bgp.png", "date_modified": "2026-05-28T00:37:19+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-15T02:15:36+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/syslog-config-feature/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/syslog-config-feature/", "title": "SYSLOG_CONFIG_FEATURE \u30c6\u30fc\u30d6\u30eb", "content_html": "SYSLOG_CONFIG_FEATURE \u30c6\u30fc\u30d6\u30eb \u2014