2", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/chassis-module.png", "date_modified": "2026-05-28T00:37:03+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-14T12:23:09+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/console-port/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/console-port/", "title": "CONSOLE_PORT / CONSOLE_SWITCH \u30c6\u30fc\u30d6\u30eb", "content_html": "CONSOLE_PORT / CONSOLE_SWITCH \u30c6\u30fc\u30d6\u30eb \u2014 SONiC \u3092 console switch \u3068\u3057\u3066\u52d5\u304b\u3059\u3068\u304d\u306e\u3001\u30b7\u30ea\u30a2\u30eb/\u30b3\u30f3\u30bd\u30fc\u30eb\u30dd\u30fc\u30c8\u306e\u8a2d\u5b9a\u30c6\u30fc\u30d6\u30eb\u7fa4\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/console-port.png", "date_modified": "2026-05-28T00:37:03+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-11T07:04:35+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/dpu-eni/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/dpu-eni/", "title": "DPU / ENI / VDPU / REMOTE_DPU \u30c6\u30fc\u30d6\u30eb", "content_html": "CONFIG_DB \u306e DPU\u30fbENI\u30fbVDPU\u30fbREMOTE_DPU \u30c6\u30fc\u30d6\u30eb \u2014 SmartSwitch \u306e DPU (Data Processing Unit) \u3068 ENI (Elastic Network Interface) \u306e\u8ee2\u9001\u60c5\u5831\u3092\u5b9a\u7fa9\u3057\u3001DashEniFwdOrch \u304c ACL \u30eb\u30fc\u30eb\u3078\u5909\u63db\u3059\u308b\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/dpu-eni.png", "date_modified": "2026-05-28T00:37:03+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-14T13:52:15+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/macsec-profile/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/macsec-profile/", "title": "MACSEC_PROFILE \u30c6\u30fc\u30d6\u30eb", "content_html": "MACSEC_PROFILE \u30c6\u30fc\u30d6\u30eb \u2014 IEEE 802.1AE MACsec \u306e\u30bb\u30ad\u30e5\u30ea\u30c6\u30a3\u30d7\u30ed\u30d5\u30a1\u30a4\u30eb\u3092\u5b9a\u7fa9\u3059\u308b\u30c6\u30fc\u30d6\u30eb\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/macsec-profile.png", "date_modified": "2026-05-28T00:37:03+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-11T07:04:35+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/nhg-table/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/nhg-table/", "title": "NEXTHOP_GROUP_TABLE / CLASS_BASED_NEXT_HOP_GROUP_TABLE", "content_html": "APPL_DB NEXTHOP_GROUP_TABLE \u304a\u3088\u3073 CLASS_BASED_NEXT_HOP_GROUP_TABLE \u2014 fpmsyncd \u304c FRR \u304b\u3089\u53d7\u3051\u53d6\u3063\u305f\u6b21\u30db\u30c3\u30d7\u30b0\u30eb\u30fc\u30d7\u3092 APPL_DB \u306b\u66f8\u304d\u8fbc\u307f\u3001orchagent \u306e NhgOrch / CbfNhgOrch \u304c SAI \u7d4c\u7531\u3067 ASIC \u306b\u53cd\u6620\u3059\u308b\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/nhg-table.png", "date_modified": "2026-05-28T00:37:03+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-15T01:56:08+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/route-orch-event/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/route-orch-event/", "title": "RouteOrch event / notification (ResponsePublisher + NextHopObserver)", "content_html": "orchagent RouteOrch \u304c\u9001\u51fa\u3059\u308b 2 \u7a2e\u985e\u306e\u901a\u77e5\u6a5f\u69cb\u2014APPL_STATE_DB \u66f8\u304d\u8fbc\u307f + RESPONSE_CHANNEL\uff08ResponsePublisher \u7d4c\u7531\uff09\u3068\u5185\u90e8 NextHopObserver\u2014\u306e